msgctxt "380"
msgid "(No time for this right now...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid "What took you so long, Uncle Kaz? I was getting tired of waiting..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid "The hell took so long, Aniki? Let's get movin'."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid ""
"You got that out of your system? Good. Let's get back on\r\n"
"the case."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid ""
"Evening, friends! What do you say to a bikini bar? We got\r\n"
"babes, we got booze, we got everything a guy could need!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid "Oh man, I've always wanted to check one of these things out!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid "(...What should we do?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid "Let's do this later, Rikiya."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "500"
msgid "If you say so, Aniki! You're the boss!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid "All right, let's take a look."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid "Yesss! You're the best, Aniki!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid "Party of two, right this way!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "560"
msgid ""
"Hey there, tough guy. What do you say to a bikini bar?\r\n"
"Only 3,000 yen to satisfy all your wildest fantasies!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "596"
msgid "Are you... going in there, Uncle Kaz?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "608"
msgid "(Shoot, I forgot Haruka was with me! What now!?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "620"
msgid ""
"Yeah, sorry. Think you can be a big girl and wait here while\r\n"
"I'm gone?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "632"
msgid "...Okay. Have fun, Uncle Kaz."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "644"
msgid "No, I'm okay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "656"
msgid "Really? I don't mind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "668"
msgid "We, uh... goin' in, Aniki?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "680"
msgid "(Shoot, I forgot Rikiya was with me! What now!?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "692"
msgid "Yeah, you wanna come?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "704"
msgid ""
"Nah, I'm not really in the mood. I'll be chillin' out here\r\n"
"when you're done, though. Later, Aniki."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "716"
msgid "Nah, it can wait."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "728"
msgid "Huh? Changed your mind?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "740"
msgid "Hold on, Kiryu. You're not going in there, are you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "752"
msgid "(Shoot, I forgot Date-san was with me! What now!?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "764"
msgid "Of course I am. Want to join me, Date-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "776"
msgid ""
"...Nah, I'm good. But you go ahead. Who am I to get in the\r\n"
"way of a man and his pleasure?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "788"
msgid "No, I'm okay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "800"
msgid "You sure? I'm cool with you going in."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "812"
msgid ""
"You're kinda... short on cash there, pal. Come back when you\r\n"
"have a few more stacks in your wallet!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "824"
msgid ""
"Not in the mood, huh? Too bad. Come back when you're up for\r\n"
"some Tokyo titties, okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "836"
msgid "Right this way, sir!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "860"
msgid "(Asia can wait. I need to get after that bag snatcher.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "884"
msgid "Hm? Are you the man from the Dragon Palace?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "896"
msgid "Yeah, I got your message."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "908"
msgid ""
"Great. There's a strange man in here waving weapons around\r\n"
"and refusing to answer us when we speak to him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "920"
msgid "Hopefully you can take care of him for us..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "944"
msgid "Please do something about that weirdo!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "956"
msgid ""
"We can't let customers in and risk exposing them to that\r\n"
"awful nutjob of a human being."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "968"
msgid "All right, I'm going. Wish me luck."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "980"
msgid ""
"Of course! I'll wish you all the luck you need if it means\r\n"
"getting rid of him!"
msgstr ""

